<title>Cabo Delgado, Mozambique: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mozambique/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mozambique-2026-10-13T21:23:52.885Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 21:23:52 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Mozambique's president has set a December deadline for civilians to surrender illegal firearms, expanding the crackdown on weapons used by insurgents in Cabo Delgado. Security forces killed another member of the Anamola group in the province. Forces linked to Erik Prince suffered a battlefield loss in Congo, with a former UFC fighter among the wounded, indicating the conflict's spillover. Three Mozambicans were repatriated after being victims of human trafficking. The insurgency caused 151 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMie0FVX3lxTFBsWkFqZzAzVzEtRXRNS09oUVZFTWJPRGhXMFlLeGhHajZUMEU3aDVEUTJCaWZxRzE4V3hFYUc0OW52Rk5WSHlOYnVvWURRR2EybVNlRTBYb3daMl9CVzRSS3d0QXNkNWw5Q3VhQ25zMTM4ZGpaMm1FWDlpWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Open Doors UK &amp;amp; Ireland&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxOYWZWTWlXYV9rQzc2amRVWG5uNEdLU0N2RU1CY3VKbEgtTTNCXzZHZGh1ZEJkOGF0NGFkdVhSUEIydW9YeHh0enE2WGFRYmpmRzJRWXc1UmZCUVR0b1ZwNjVHa0FmVS1jaFVtSlVjNTA3SFo4S2dfVkx6YXQ2dVFFeFhWcHZmcWNlZW1ibnVrTnRUWTE5RHlXVkFXclNkUklPQUtuRA?oc=5&quot;&gt;aimnews.org&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxQb0d1RVpsaDYtdnQ5WWhhenBOeENTQXFYUFhwaDF3LVJVRlRLcVA1cG9VUnRRQ1huTHFfOVpUTjdQb19GYk1NWk8yWTRobEhWLURYZFVpSDlTbGxRTkFNbGNra2l0OGJoWmlMNm1NSmxXTWNjLVRVUEpuVXFyV3JQT1k0bGFtdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Voice of Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxOc0JmOFZ5TEgzWGxkSGtSTV9Xdy14TkVnSzRYR1ZfZG5QZHcwUi1tdkp0a0Y0UVBSME5nNXNyUXc1VVNEcy1ZVTdmcmpkaFNnUHRDNjZrZGZMOTQ4UG5sck1LbzNDbTJJZExXQ2NNclJZdUJYMmZ4ZzFNUTZLOENWVWhDbGQ5T2FGNS02YVJSNHlNVEpZaWdDcG5oMVlRTm1Ra3BvMWREUU9ZaHBR?oc=5&quot;&gt;CLUB OF MOZAMBIQUE&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxNdUct